<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">As of Chrome 135, <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/GPUDevice/createPipelineLayout" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">GPUDevice.createPipelineLayout</code></a> supports <code class="notranslate">null</code> entries in the <code class="notranslate">bindGroupLayouts</code> array. See <a href="https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-webgpu-135#allow_creating_pipeline_layout_with_null_bind_group_layout" rel="nofollow">https://developer.chrome.com/blog/new-in-webgpu-135#allow_creating_pipeline_layout_with_null_bind_group_layout</a> for details.</p>
<p dir="auto">This PR adds details for this feature, plus a quick example snippet.</p>

